Package: amat
Title: Active Mode Appraisal Toolkit in R
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Robin Lovelace [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Robin Lovelace <rob00x@gmail.com>
Authors@R: person("Robin", "Lovelace", email = "rob00x@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A concise, pure base-R implementation of the UK Department for
    Transport (DfT) Active Mode Appraisal Toolkit (AMAT). Evaluates economic,
    health, decongestion, environmental, and ambience benefits and costs of active
    travel schemes following official TAG methodology without external dependencies.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
